{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_027800","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"“Paz”这个名字是妈妈给我取的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"听说这个名字寄托着她希望这个国家今后也能保持和平的愿望。在中美洲，这是个很常见的名字。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":129,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"妈妈经常跟我讲这些。不能发动战争，必须一直守护和平。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"我记得，你的祖父母……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"嗯，他们死于内战。所以我想，妈妈才会更加厌恶战争。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"这点你也和Kaz一样。听说“和平”这个名字也是他母亲取的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"这样啊，日本也经历过战争嘛。我好像能理解Miller先生母亲的心情。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":"JPN_EXPERIENCED_WAR_NOT_SUFFERED_PRIMARY"}]}